{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">中環灣仔繞道發生驚險走狗事件！網絡熱傳一段車Cam片段，顯示一隻白色寵物犬突然闖入中環灣仔繞道管道內亂跑，後方有身穿反光衣的隧道職員急忙尾隨追趕，場面險象環生，途經司機見狀隨即報警。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-28-11h24m03s196.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026kWShQTrixH1787887970.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-28-11h24m03s196.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">警方表示，於昨日（27日）下午 5 時 02 分接獲途經司機報案。據悉，事發時一名外傭正帶同該隻 2 歲大的白色寵物犬，前往東岸公園近天后興發街海濱長廊遛狗。期間疑因牽引繩意外鬆脫，狗隻隨即逃脫並一路奔跑，由灣仔北入口闖入中環灣仔繞道東行方向管道。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-28-11h27m47s563.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026KgUbnmdv4I1787887984.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-28-11h27m47s563.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">接報後，警員聯同隧道職員及愛協人員迅速趕赴現場，多方展開圍捕攔截，最終成功將狗隻救起並帶返安全位置。涉事狗隻右前腿受傷流血，隨後由愛協人員帶返中心交由獸醫作進一步治理及驗傷。警方已成功聯絡狗主跟進後續事宜。</p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-28T03:59:29.914228+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":320,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}